<<
/A 816 0 R
/Alt (The flow diagram has three main sections: Identification, Screening, and Included. In Identification, four databases were searched, yielding 548 records: Web of Science \(212\), Scopus \(267\), Google Scholar \(39\), and PubMed \(30\). Before screening, 159 duplicate records were removed. In Screening, 389 records were screened and 303 were excluded. A total of 86 reports were assessed for eligibility, of which 76 were excluded with reasons. In the final section, Included, 10 studies were included in the review.)
/K 6
/P 232 0 R
/Pg 14 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
